{
  "schema": "eec-swc-1.0",
  "description": "Additional test SWCs exercising: multiple SWCs hosted on one ECU, several senders on one bus, and a multi-bus (broadcast) message. Bit layout and DLC are auto-derived from each signal type.",
  "swcs": [
